### PyCharm HTTP Client. Avval: docker compose up --build  va  python -m app.scripts.seed
@host = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 1. Bemor kirishi (token avtomatik saqlanadi)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=998900000003&password=patient123

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.access_token); %}

### 2. Shifokorlar
GET {{host}}/doctors?specialty=stom

### 3. Bo'sh vaqtlar (sanani o'zgartiring - ish kuni bo'lsin)
GET {{host}}/doctors/1/slots?date=2026-11-05

### 4. Navbat olish (start_at ni 3-so'rov javobidagi slotdan oling)
POST {{host}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"doctor_id": 1, "start_at": "2026-11-05T10:00:00+05:00"}

### 5. Mening navbatlarim
GET {{host}}/appointments/my
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Navbatni bekor qilish
PATCH {{host}}/appointments/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Shifokor kirishi
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=998900000002&password=doctor123

> {% client.global.set("doc_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### 8. Kabinet inventari - umumiy ko'rinish (bor / kam / buzuq / yo'q)
GET {{host}}/cabinets/1/instruments/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{doc_token}}

### 9. Asbob qo'shish (katalogda bo'lmasa avtomatik yaratiladi)
POST {{host}}/cabinets/1/instruments
Authorization: Bearer {{doc_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Dental tokar", "category": "Terapiya", "quantity": 2, "min_quantity": 1}

### 10. Sonini o'zgartirish
PATCH {{host}}/cabinets/1/instruments/5
Authorization: Bearer {{doc_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantity": 10, "reason": "Yangi partiya keldi"}

### 11. O'zgarishlar tarixi (audit)
GET {{host}}/cabinets/1/instruments/logs
Authorization: Bearer {{doc_token}}
